 "title": "CHINA BUILT THE WORLD’S LARGEST TELESCOPE. THEN CAME THE TOURISTS",
 "excerpt": "Thousands of people moved to let China build and protect the world’s largest telescope. And then the government drew in orders of magnitude more tourists, potentially undercutting its own science in an attempt to…",
